      "n_tokens_est": 2,
      "pos_start_est": 357
    },
    {
      "node_id": 2,
      "seq_id": 1,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "Introduction",
      "n_tokens_est": 1,
      "pos_start_est": 359
    },
    {
      "node_id": 2,
      "seq_id": 1,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "sec:intro",
      "n_tokens_est": 3,
      "pos_start_est": 360
    },
    {
      "node_id": 2,
      "seq_id": 1,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": " Deep convolutional neural networks ",
      "n_tokens_est": 4,
      "pos_start_est": 363
    },
    {
      "node_id": 2,
      "seq_id": 1,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "\\cite",
      "n_tokens_est": 2,
      "pos_start_est": 367
    },
    {
      "node_id": 2,
      "seq_id": 1,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "LeCun1989,Krizhevsky2012",
      "n_tokens_est": 3,
      "pos_start_est": 369
    },
    {
      "node_id": 2,
      "seq_id": 1,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": " have led to a series of breakthroughs for image classification ",
      "n_tokens_est": 10,
      "pos_start_est": 372
    },
    {
      "node_id": 2,
      "seq_id": 1,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "\\cite",
      "n_tokens_est": 2,
      "pos_start_est": 382
    },
    {
      "node_id": 2,
      "seq_id": 1,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "Krizhevsky2012,Zeiler2014,Sermanet2014",
      "n_tokens_est": 5,
      "pos_start_est": 384
    },
    {
      "node_id": 2,
      "seq_id": 1,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": ". Deep networks naturally integrate low/mid/high-level features ",
      "n_tokens_est": 13,
      "pos_start_est": 389
    },
    {
      "node_id": 2,
      "seq_id": 1,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "\\cite",
      "n_tokens_est": 2,
      "pos_start_est": 402
    },
    {
      "node_id": 2,
      "seq_id": 1,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "Zeiler2014",
      "n_tokens_est": 1,
      "pos_start_est": 404
    },
    {
      "node_id": 2,
      "seq_id": 1,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": " and classifiers in an end-to-end multi-layer fashion, and the ",
      "n_tokens_est": 16,
      "pos_start_est": 405
    },
    {
      "node_id": 2,
      "seq_id": 1,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "``",
      "n_tokens_est": 2,
      "pos_start_est": 421
    },
    {
      "node_id": 2,
      "seq_id": 1,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "levels",
      "n_tokens_est": 1,
      "pos_start_est": 423
    },
    {
      "node_id": 2,
      "seq_id": 1,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "''",
      "n_tokens_est": 2,
      "pos_start_est": 424
    },
    {
      "node_id": 2,
      "seq_id": 1,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": " of features can be enriched by the number of stacked layers (depth). Recent evidence ",
      "n_tokens_est": 17,
      "pos_start_est": 426
    },
    {
      "node_id": 2,
      "seq_id": 1,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "\\cite",
      "n_tokens_est": 2,
      "pos_start_est": 443
    },
    {
      "node_id": 2,
      "seq_id": 1,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "Simonyan2015,Szegedy2015",
      "n_tokens_est": 3,
      "pos_start_est": 445
    },
    {
      "node_id": 2,
      "seq_id": 1,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": " reveals that network depth is of crucial importance, and the leading results ",
      "n_tokens_est": 13,
      "pos_start_est": 448
    },
    {
      "node_id": 2,
      "seq_id": 1,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "\\cite",
      "n_tokens_est": 2,
      "pos_start_est": 461
    },
    {
      "node_id": 2,
      "seq_id": 1,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "Simonyan2015,Szegedy2015,He2015,Ioffe2015",
      "n_tokens_est": 7,
      "pos_start_est": 463
    },
    {
      "node_id": 2,
      "seq_id": 1,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": " on the challenging ImageNet dataset ",
      "n_tokens_est": 5,
      "pos_start_est": 470
    },
    {
      "node_id": 2,
      "seq_id": 1,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "\\cite",
      "n_tokens_est": 2,
      "pos_start_est": 475
    },
    {
      "node_id": 2,
      "seq_id": 1,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "Russakovsky2014",
      "n_tokens_est": 1,
      "pos_start_est": 477
    },
    {
      "node_id": 2,
      "seq_id": 1,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": " all exploit ",
      "n_tokens_est": 2,
      "pos_start_est": 478
    },
    {
      "node_id": 2,
      "seq_id": 1,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "``",
      "n_tokens_est": 2,
      "pos_start_est": 480
    },
    {
      "node_id": 2,
      "seq_id": 1,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "very deep",
      "n_tokens_est": 2,
      "pos_start_est": 482
    },
    {
      "node_id": 2,
      "seq_id": 1,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "''",
