      "pos_start_est": 484
    },
    {
      "node_id": 2,
      "seq_id": 1,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "\\cite",
      "n_tokens_est": 2,
      "pos_start_est": 486
    },
    {
      "node_id": 2,
      "seq_id": 1,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "Simonyan2015",
      "n_tokens_est": 1,
      "pos_start_est": 488
    },
    {
      "node_id": 2,
      "seq_id": 1,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": " models, with a depth of sixteen ",
      "n_tokens_est": 7,
      "pos_start_est": 489
    },
    {
      "node_id": 2,
      "seq_id": 1,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "\\cite",
      "n_tokens_est": 2,
      "pos_start_est": 496
    },
    {
      "node_id": 2,
      "seq_id": 1,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "Simonyan2015",
      "n_tokens_est": 1,
      "pos_start_est": 498
    },
    {
      "node_id": 2,
      "seq_id": 1,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": " to thirty ",
      "n_tokens_est": 2,
      "pos_start_est": 499
    },
    {
      "node_id": 2,
      "seq_id": 1,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "\\cite",
      "n_tokens_est": 2,
      "pos_start_est": 501
    },
    {
      "node_id": 2,
      "seq_id": 1,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "Ioffe2015",
      "n_tokens_est": 1,
      "pos_start_est": 503
    },
    {
      "node_id": 2,
      "seq_id": 1,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": ". Many other nontrivial visual recognition tasks ",
      "n_tokens_est": 7,
      "pos_start_est": 504
    },
    {
      "node_id": 2,
      "seq_id": 1,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "\\cite",
      "n_tokens_est": 2,
      "pos_start_est": 511
    },
    {
      "node_id": 2,
      "seq_id": 1,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "Girshick2014,He2014,Girshick2015,Ren2015,Long2015",
      "n_tokens_est": 9,
      "pos_start_est": 513
    },
    {
      "node_id": 2,
      "seq_id": 1,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": " have also greatly benefited from very deep models. Driven by the significance of depth, a question arises: ",
      "n_tokens_est": 20,
      "pos_start_est": 522
    },
    {
      "node_id": 2,
      "seq_id": 1,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "\\emph",
      "n_tokens_est": 2,
      "pos_start_est": 542
    },
    {
      "node_id": 2,
      "seq_id": 1,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "Is learning better networks as easy as stacking more layers?",
      "n_tokens_est": 11,
      "pos_start_est": 544
    },
    {
      "node_id": 2,
      "seq_id": 1,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": " An obstacle to answering this question was the notorious problem of vanishing/exploding gradients ",
      "n_tokens_est": 15,
      "pos_start_est": 555
    },
    {
      "node_id": 2,
      "seq_id": 1,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "\\cite",
      "n_tokens_est": 2,
      "pos_start_est": 570
    },
    {
      "node_id": 2,
      "seq_id": 1,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "Bengio1994,Glorot2010",
      "n_tokens_est": 3,
      "pos_start_est": 572
    },
    {
      "node_id": 2,
      "seq_id": 1,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": ", which hamper convergence from the beginning. This problem, however, has been largely addressed by normalized initialization ",
      "n_tokens_est": 20,
      "pos_start_est": 575
    },
    {
      "node_id": 2,
      "seq_id": 1,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "\\cite",
      "n_tokens_est": 2,
      "pos_start_est": 595
    },
    {
      "node_id": 2,
      "seq_id": 1,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "LeCun1998,Glorot2010,Saxe2013,He2015",
      "n_tokens_est": 7,
      "pos_start_est": 597
    },
    {
      "node_id": 2,
      "seq_id": 1,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": " and intermediate normalization layers ",
      "n_tokens_est": 4,
      "pos_start_est": 604
    },
    {
      "node_id": 2,
      "seq_id": 1,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "\\cite",
      "n_tokens_est": 2,
      "pos_start_est": 608
    },
    {
      "node_id": 2,
      "seq_id": 1,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "Ioffe2015",
      "n_tokens_est": 1,
      "pos_start_est": 610
    },
    {
      "node_id": 2,
      "seq_id": 1,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": ", which enable networks with tens of layers to start converging for stochastic gradient descent (SGD) with backpropagation ",
      "n_tokens_est": 20,
      "pos_start_est": 611
    },
    {
      "node_id": 2,
      "seq_id": 1,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "\\cite",
      "n_tokens_est": 2,
      "pos_start_est": 631
    },
    {
      "node_id": 2,
      "seq_id": 1,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "LeCun1989",
      "n_tokens_est": 1,
      "pos_start_est": 633
    },
    {
      "node_id": 2,
      "seq_id": 1,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": ". ",
      "n_tokens_est": 1,
      "pos_start_est": 634
    },
    {
      "node_id": 2,
      "seq_id": 1,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "\\begin{figure}",
      "n_tokens_est": 5,
      "pos_start_est": 635
    },
    {
